{"about_the_game":"<strong><u>EASY DELIVERY</u></strong><br>Use the hand truck to unload large deliveries easily. You can also organize boxes or transport them to storage with the hand truck.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/58555acdb4f568efd555893b0c8be69e.poster.avif?t=1756417505\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/58555acdb4f568efd555893b0c8be69e.webm?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/58555acdb4f568efd555893b0c8be69e.mp4?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong><u>RESTOCK SHELVES</u></strong><br>Restock the shelves and keep your supermarket fully stocked at all times. Keep your shelves organized<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/b5018a979697ec2bc27deecdb764c13b.poster.avif?t=1756417505\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/b5018a979697ec2bc27deecdb764c13b.webm?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/b5018a979697ec2bc27deecdb764c13b.mp4?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong><u>HANDLE PAYMENTS</u></strong><br>Process cash or credit card payments quickly with easy-to-use UIs. Serve customers on time and prevent long queues to keep your supermarket running smoothly.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/388ad2be6a16cadce921863414a15862.poster.avif?t=1756417505\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/388ad2be6a16cadce921863414a15862.webm?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/388ad2be6a16cadce921863414a15862.mp4?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong><u>INSTALL VENDING MACHINES</u></strong><br>Manually handling every customer\u2019s payment can be tiring. Place vending machines outside and let customers serve themselves while you earn passive income. Do not forget to keep them restocked<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/333adefbb3a90bda29ab7efc3f7ff465.poster.avif?t=1756417505\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/333adefbb3a90bda29ab7efc3f7ff465.webm?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/333adefbb3a90bda29ab7efc3f7ff465.mp4?t=1756417505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong><u>KEEP CLEAN</u></strong><br>Keep your store clean by removing empty boxes. You can even use the hand truck to collect and transport them to the trash bin in piles.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/0c7f4489ea4a685ce7f9c101345ba113.poster.avif?t=1756417505\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/0c7f4489ea4a685ce7f9c1013